<title>USA: Hudson, Wis., $1.975 mln won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 17:09 GMT]</title>
<headline>Hudson, Wis., $1.975 mln won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 17:09 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said Monday it won $1.975 million Hudson, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.24 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects that Dain Bosworth won the notes. Also supplies Dain's winning true interest cost).</p>
